<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Becton Dickinson.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Becton Dickinson.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Prudential Securities cut its rating on Becton Dickinson and Co to hold from buy, a source at the brokerage said.</p>
<p>-- Further details were not available.</p>
